+## Browser file opening
+
+An optional browser plugin can provide chatWorkspaceOpener to open produced files and supported Markdown file destinations using the owning Session. The provider identifies supported destinations and enforces workspace access; without it, produced files retain the Host opener and Markdown retains its URL allowlist.
