+## Browser file opening
+
+MarkdownFileMentions.resolveLink optionally turns an authored Markdown destination into a file-opening button. The owner supplies the callback, accessible label, and title; unresolved destinations retain the ordinary URL allowlist. The primitive does not navigate to file URLs or access the filesystem.
